{"version": 2, "width": 88, "height": 24, "title": "MCP examples: context recovery and adding S3", "duration": 47.55, "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[?25l\u001b[1;38;2;139;233;253m01/04  Two additional MCP examples\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mSEPARATE HISTORICAL EXAMPLES\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mEdited reenactments based on project sessions.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mThese are not continuations of the three-protocol install.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mEDITED REENACTMENT | Silent preview; narration supplied separately.\u001b[0m"]
[10.89, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[?25l\u001b[1;38;2;139;233;253m02/04  1. Recover the operation context\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mcheck_operation()\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mLarge operation log returned through the tool harness.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mSaved output reviewed for failures, recap and completion.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mSummarize the evidence before deciding the next action.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mEDITED REENACTMENT | Silent preview; narration supplied separately.\u001b[0m"]
[26.67, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[?25l\u001b[1;38;2;139;233;253m03/04  2. Add S3 to an existing cluster\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mDIFFERENT SESSION: NFS and SMB already running\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mEnable S3 -> deploy precheck -> deploy\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mRecorded result: S3 ACTIVE; NFS and SMB remain active.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mThis is an extension, not the earlier fresh installation.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mEDITED REENACTMENT | Silent preview; narration supplied separately.\u001b[0m"]
[41.11, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[?25l\u001b[1;38;2;139;233;253m04/04  Closing\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mCHECK STATE -> MAKE THE CHANGE -> VERIFY\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mSee the full MCP story for an end-to-end example.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;2;243;244;246mEDITED REENACTMENT | Silent preview; narration supplied separately.\u001b[0m"]
